          <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="376" resized="true" width="121" x="91" y="130">Credit_Mix and Credit_Score were excluded as required by Task A. Other categorical attributes were excluded to avoid introducing artificial distances through encoding, while Customer_ID was removed as it carries no financial meaning.</description>
          <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="175" resized="false" width="180" x="227" y="142">Applied domain-based validity checks to identify unrealistic values and convert them to missing values before imputation; Monthly_Income was recalculated from Annual_Income for consistency.</description>
          <description align="center" color="orange" colored="true" height="103" resized="false" width="126" x="493" y="136">Recalculated and standardised derived financial attributes after cleaning.</description>
